index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..03d08bd7568557412d970733a922feccdb24e381
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.scratch/basin/spec.md
@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+# BASIN barrier diagnostic completion criterion
+
+One unattended, one-process run under the mandated interpreter, niceness, and
+single-thread controls must:
+
+- reproduce the sealed 12-anchor `NEAREST_ELIGIBLE` and
+  `FIRST_IMPROVEMENT_FP` pooled EE values to six decimals before computing new
+  findings;
+- emit every requested BASE-to-RSS_MAX path, exact rational `F` values,
+  unilateral checks, restart endpoints, six-arm rankings, bounded-catalogue
+  diagnostics, and reference-profile interaction signs;
+- print `anchor k/N` progress and peak RSS, with peak RSS below 5 GB; and
+- read development anchors only and no learner checkpoint.
